## How to contribute

{{- if eq .Config.Platform "gitlab" }}

1. Search [existing work items](https://{{ .VCS.ProjectHost }}/{{ .VCS.ProjectPath }}/-/work_items) before opening a new one.
2. Fork the repository and create a branch off the default branch.
{{- if has "gitflow-branches" .Config.PreCommit }}
  Name it `<type>/<slug>` with `<type>` one of chore/docs/feat/fix/release (e.g. `feat/my-feature`), pre-commit rejects other names.
{{- end }}
3. Make your change, add or update tests (extend existing tests whenever possible), update docs.
4. Open a [merge request](https://{{ .VCS.ProjectHost }}/{{ .VCS.ProjectPath }}/-/merge_requests).
{{- end }}

